1
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:19,988
Bonjour, Marinette. Tu es libre demain ?
Hello, Marinette. Are you free tomorrow?

2
00:00:20,088 --> 00:00:26,084
Bonjour, Adrien. Oui, je suis libre demain.
Hello, Adrien. Yes, I’m free tomorrow.

3
00:00:26,184 --> 00:00:29,012
Nous avons une réunion.
We have a meeting.

4
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:31,484
Quand ?
When?

5
00:00:31,584 --> 00:00:36,644
Demain, à dix heures. Tu peux venir ?
Tomorrow, at ten. Can you come?

6
00:00:36,744 --> 00:00:40,556
Oui, je peux venir à dix heures.
Yes, I can come at ten.

7
00:00:40,656 --> 00:00:43,028
Au bureau ?
At the office?

8
00:00:43,128 --> 00:00:47,660
Oui, au bureau. Merci !
Yes, at the office. Thank you!

9
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:50,828
À demain, alors.
See you tomorrow, then.
